WEBVTT

00:05:58.109 --> 00:06:00.561
so that the next time
something big changes,

00:06:00.585 --> 00:06:02.185
you're already prepared.

00:06:02.569 --> 00:06:05.759
We're entering a future where IQ and EQ

00:06:05.783 --> 00:06:09.418
both matter way less
than how fast you're able to adapt.

00:06:09.442 --> 00:06:12.428
So I hope that these tools
help you to raise your own AQ.

00:06:12.982 --> 00:06:14.133
Thank you.

00:06:14.157 --> 00:06:18.079
(Applause)